# gates-rotate hook: the merge-time close point. A MERGED closing row is when old, delivered gates
# ledgers get swept (the just-merged slice's own file is fresh and stays; the >30d mtime screen is
# what the sweep keys on). TOTAL like _backup: nothing here may cost the row just written. Fixture
# guard: a fixture ledger (MR_RECORD_LEDGER) must never judge the REAL gates dir, so the hook only
